add('03-classify/recall95','valid=[t for t in np.arange(.05,.96,.01) if recall_score(y_validation,p>=t)>=.95]\nthr=round(float(max(valid)),2)\nprecision_at=round(precision_score(y_validation,p>=thr),3)\nn_flagged=int((p>=thr).sum())\nprecision_05=round(precision_score(y_validation,p>=.5),3);recall_05=round(recall_score(y_validation,p>=.5),3)\np_test=model.predict_proba(X_test)[:,1]\ntest_recall=round(recall_score(y_test,p_test>=thr),3)\ntest_flagged=int((p_test>=thr).sum())','thr максимальная точка сетки с validation recall≥.95;test_recall/test_flagged только после фиксации по независимому тесту')
